{"title": "Druid Notebook", "pageid": 3723, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Druid_Notebook", "categories": ["Books", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book_Generic_K_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Book_Generic_K_Image.png/300px-Book_Generic_K_Image.png.webp, /w/images/8/85/Book_Generic_K_Image.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Druid Notebook image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Book_Generic_K_Image.png/300px-Book_Generic_K_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Book_Generic_K_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Druid Notebook</b> recounts the story of a battle against <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ketheric Thorm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\">Ketheric Thorm</a>, which also references the glaive <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sorrow\" title=\"Sorrow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Glaive_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Glaive_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Glaive_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Glaive_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Glaive_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Glaive_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Glaive_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Glaive_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Glaive_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sorrow\" title=\"Sorrow\">Sorrow</a>. This text is written by an unknown Druid of <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Emerald Grove\">Emerald Grove</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>An ageing notebook telling the fragmented story of an accidental death and a cursed blade.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Books\" title=\"Books\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/25px-Books_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/38px-Books_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/50px-Books_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Books\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/25px-Books_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Books_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Books\" title=\"Books\">Books</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Author:  Circle of the Emerald Grove\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Author: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_the_Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Circle of the Emerald Grove\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Emerald_Enclave.webp/25px-Emerald_Enclave.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Emerald_Enclave.webp/38px-Emerald_Enclave.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Emerald_Enclave.webp/50px-Emerald_Enclave.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Circle of the Emerald Grove\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Emerald_Enclave.webp/25px-Emerald_Enclave.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Emerald_Enclave.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_the_Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Circle of the Emerald Grove\">Circle of the Emerald Grove</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-ace0a17aad5e5cfcEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-7d1466fc14a99a75END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_DEN_DruidDiary</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_DEN_DruidDiary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_DEN_DruidDiary\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">578b18a9-fb6c-4ac0-95bc-b9ff50a8e61b</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:578b18a9-fb6c-4ac0-95bc-b9ff50a8e61b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:578b18a9-fb6c-4ac0-95bc-b9ff50a8e61b\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Druids%27_Chambers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Druids' Chambers\">Druids' Chambers</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-435&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;3</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This is an ancient notebook, whose ink is faded and pages are starting to crumble. It's not easy, but some words can still be made out.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\nKetheric is finished, but it cost us the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Lands\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Lands\">land</a>. Darkness has fallen, corruption is everywhere.\n</p><p><br>\n[...]\n</p><p><br>\n...chased by shadows, picking us off, <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">druids</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Harpers\" title=\"Harpers\">Harpers</a> alike. \n</p><p><br>\n[...]\n</p><p><br>\n...our wounded were safe, I returned, searching for survivors... \n</p><p><br>\n[...]\n</p><p><br>\n...lost, but I found his shade. I put it to rest and took his glaive...\n</p><p><br>\n[...]\n</p><p><br>\n...blade infused with shadow. I have locked it away, to serve as a reminder that even victory can taste bitter.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Given the location of his journal, and what is known about his backstory, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halsin\" title=\"Halsin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/25px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/38px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/50px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Halsin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/25px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Halsin\" title=\"Halsin\">Halsin</a> may be the author of this notebook.</li>\n<li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Account\" title=\"Personal Account\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/eb/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/eb/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/eb/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/eb/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/eb/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Account\" title=\"Personal Account\">Personal Account</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report